      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumberland_County%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 1908 monument in Greenwich honors patriots dressed as Native Americans who burned tea bound for Philadelphia.",
